{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared test vectors for the day of the shift — Scope §5.1, §5.2, §5.2b and",
    "RULE-01 / 02 / 14 / 15. These vectors are the contract between the TypeScript",
    "implementation in packages/domain/pay.ts and the Postgres functions",
    "check_in_decision / check_out_decision / payable_minutes / turned_away_minutes",
    "in supabase/migrations/0005_checkin_checkout.sql. Both must agree case for case:",
    "Vitest reads this file directly, pgTAP reads the generated",
    "supabase/tests/_shared/pay_vectors.psql (pnpm --filter @thc/domain gen:vectors).",
    "",
    "Times are minute offsets so neither side has to agree on a calendar:",
    "  shiftMin              length of the ROLE SECTION (RULE-18), never the event window",
    "  ...MinFromStart       minutes from the scheduled start; negative = before it",
    "The 30-minute check-in grace is [start, start+30): at exactly start+30 the grace",
    "has elapsed, so check-in locks (wireframes/staff/shift-detail.html state (l):",
    "'Check-in window 16:30 - 17:30') and a turn-away at that instant is late.",
    "Owned by the `checkin` bot."
  ],

  "checkIn": {
    "$comment": [
      "check_in_decision, §5.1. Gate order, and it is load-bearing:",
      "  1 too early   check-in opens 30 minutes before the start",
      "  2 out of radius  you cannot check in from off site",
      "  3 turned away    strict buffer, headcount already met (RULE-15). This sits",
      "                   ABOVE the No-show lock because RULE-15 itself describes a",
      "                   turned-away worker 'who was themselves late', which is",
      "                   unreachable if the lock fires first.",
      "  4 locked         start+30 with no check-in = automatic No-show, button locks",
      "                   (exempt: a booking confirmed after the shift had started)",
      "  5 checked in, Late if the press is after the scheduled start",
      "turnAwayPayMin is RULE-15 money and is null for every decision but turned_away."
    ],
    "defaults": {
      "shiftMin": 480,
      "insideGeofence": true,
      "confirmedMinFromStart": -1440,
      "slotsFilled": 0,
      "headcount": 6,
      "strictBuffer": true
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "check-in opens 30 minutes before the scheduled start",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": -30 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": false,
          "minutesLate": 0,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a press before the window opens is refused and not logged",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": -31 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "too_early",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": null,
          "late": false,
          "minutesLate": 0,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "check_in_not_open"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "out of radius disables check-in, and the attempt is still logged",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": -5, "insideGeofence": false },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "out_of_radius",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": "out_of_radius",
          "late": false,
          "minutesLate": 0,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "out_of_radius"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "on the stroke of the start is on time, not Late",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 0 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": false,
          "minutesLate": 0,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "30 minutes of grace counts as Late, with the minutes from the actual press",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 20 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in_late",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 20,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in_late"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the last minute of the grace is still Late, not a No-show",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 29 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in_late",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 29,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in_late"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "at start+30 the grace has elapsed: automatic No-show and the button locks",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 30 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": null,
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 30,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "no_show_locked"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "well past the grace the button is still locked",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 75 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": null,
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 75,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "no_show_locked"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a booking confirmed after the shift started is exempt from the lock",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 120, "confirmedMinFromStart": 60 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in_late",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 120,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in_late"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a booking confirmed exactly at the start is not exempt",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 40, "confirmedMinFromStart": 0 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": null,
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 40,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "no_show_locked"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the exemption ends with the shift itself",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 481, "confirmedMinFromStart": 60 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": null,
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 481,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "no_show_locked"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the last check-in inside the headcount works",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 5, "slotsFilled": 5, "headcount": 6 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in_late",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 5,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in_late"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "past the headcount a strict-buffer worker is turned away, 4 hours if on time",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 10, "slotsFilled": 6, "headcount": 6 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "turned_away",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": "turned_away",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 10,
          "turnAwayPayMin": 240,
          "messageKey": "turned_away_paid"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a turn-away who was themselves late is paid nothing (RULE-15)",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 45, "slotsFilled": 6, "headcount": 6 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "turned_away",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": "turned_away",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 45,
          "turnAwayPayMin": 0,
          "messageKey": "turned_away_unpaid"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a client that pays the buffer turns nobody away",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 10, "slotsFilled": 7, "headcount": 6, "strictBuffer": false },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "checked_in_late",
          "accepted": true,
          "logOutcome": "checked_in",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 10,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "checked_in_late"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a full shift does not turn away someone who is off site — they see the distance first",
        "input": {
          "atMinFromStart": 10,
          "slotsFilled": 6,
          "headcount": 6,
          "insideGeofence": false
        },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "out_of_radius",
          "accepted": false,
          "logOutcome": "out_of_radius",
          "late": true,
          "minutesLate": 10,
          "turnAwayPayMin": null,
          "messageKey": "out_of_radius"
        }
      }
    ]
  },

  "checkOut": {
    "$comment": [
      "check_out_decision, §5.1 and RULE-02. Check-out is open from the scheduled",
      "start until four hours after the scheduled end, FROM ANYWHERE — the geofence",
      "only decides which timestamp is recorded and which message the worker sees.",
      "recordedMinFromStart is the timestamp RULE-01 then prices, so the off-site",
      "press records the last on-site fix, never the press itself.",
      "leftEarly (audit D5, ADR-0032): the press is more than 15 minutes before the",
      "scheduled end and the check-out goes through, on site or off. It raises the",
      "'Left early' violation (§9.5) that blocks RULE-14's floor, alongside whatever",
      "`violation` says. A stale off-site fix (D15): more than 30 minutes before the",
      "press AND before the end is still recorded, but raises No check-out for a",
      "manager to confirm."
    ],
    "defaults": {
      "shiftMin": 480,
      "insideGeofence": true,
      "checkInMinFromStart": -8,
      "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": null
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "check-out is not available before the shift has started",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": -5 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "not_started",
          "recordedMinFromStart": null,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "check_out_not_open",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "on site records the moment the button was pressed",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 480,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "checking out early is allowed and records the press",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 300 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 300,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "off site records the last on-site fix, not the press (left 16:00, pressed 21:00) — and a fix that old is reviewed",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 660, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 420 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 420,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "off site is open right up to four hours after the end",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 719, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 480,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "off site with no on-site fix after check-in raises the violation on the press",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 600, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": null },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "no_on_site_fix",
          "recordedMinFromStart": -8,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "no_check_out_office_confirms",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "at four hours past the end the button locks and RULE-02 takes over",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 720, "insideGeofence": true },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "recordedMinFromStart": null,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "no_check_out_locked",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the lock does not care whether the worker is on site",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 900, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "locked",
          "recordedMinFromStart": null,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "no_check_out_locked",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "checking out on site 15 minutes before the end is not Left early",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 465 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 465,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "checking out on site 16 minutes before the end is Left early",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 464 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 464,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a 14:00-22:00 shift checked out on site at 15:00 is Left early (audit D5)",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 60 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 60,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "an off-site press before the end is Left early too",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 300, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 290 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 290,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a fix taken just after check-in and a press hours later is reviewed (audit D15)",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 470, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": -7 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": -7,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a fix 30 minutes before the press is not stale",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 400, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 370 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 370,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a fix within 30 minutes of the end is not stale, however late the press",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 700, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 450 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 450,
          "violation": "none",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a fix 31 minutes before both the press and the end is stale",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 480, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": 449 },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "recorded_last_on_site",
          "recordedMinFromStart": 449,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "checked_out_off_site",
          "leftEarly": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "off site with no fix, pressed early, is both No check-out and Left early",
        "input": { "atMinFromStart": 120, "insideGeofence": false, "lastOnSiteMinFromStart": null },
        "expect": {
          "decision": "no_on_site_fix",
          "recordedMinFromStart": -8,
          "violation": "no_checkout",
          "messageKey": "no_check_out_office_confirms",
          "leftEarly": true
        }
      }
    ]
  },

  "pay": {
    "$comment": [
      "payable_minutes, RULE-01 / 02 / 14. checkOutMinFromStart null = no check-out",
      "and no manager-entered finish: the payable time is UNDETERMINED, never a",
      "silent default to the scheduled finish. An EMPTY intersection is undetermined",
      "for the same reason: RULE-14's floor is for a worker who actually checked in",
      "and worked the shift, and RULE-02 makes the zero-length case a violation."
    ],
    "defaults": {
      "shiftMin": 480,
      "checkInMinFromStart": 0,
      "unpaidBreakMin": 0,
      "leftEarlyViolation": false,
      "noCheckOut": "none"
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "arriving early is not paid",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": -30, "checkOutMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "inside the 30-minute grace is paid from the scheduled start",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 20, "checkOutMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "past the grace is paid from the actual arrival",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 45, "checkOutMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 435,
          "workedMin": 435,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "leaving early is deducted",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 420 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 420,
          "workedMin": 420,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the 15-minute check-out grace pays to the scheduled end, not the press",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 495 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "past 15 minutes the monitor flags it and the money is unchanged",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 500 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "three hours late still pays only to the scheduled end",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 660 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unpaid breaks are deducted (§5.2b)",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 480, "unpaidBreakMin": 20 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 460,
          "workedMin": 460,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "no check-out and no manager finish time leaves the pay undetermined",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": null },
        "expect": {
          "status": "undetermined",
          "payableMin": null,
          "workedMin": null,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the manager-entered finish time settles it (RULE-02)",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 450, "noCheckOut": "resolved" },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 450,
          "workedMin": 450,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a short shift is lifted to the four-hour floor (RULE-14)",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 120 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 240,
          "workedMin": 120,
          "floorApplied": true,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a Left early violation blocks the floor, resolved or not",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 120, "leftEarlyViolation": true },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 120,
          "workedMin": 120,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "an unresolved No check-out blocks the floor",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 120, "noCheckOut": "unresolved" },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 120,
          "workedMin": 120,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "resolving the No check-out restores the floor",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 120, "noCheckOut": "resolved" },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 240,
          "workedMin": 120,
          "floorApplied": true,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the floor never inflates a shift already over four hours",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 480 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 480,
          "workedMin": 480,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "breaks can bring a shift under the floor, and the floor still applies",
        "input": { "shiftMin": 300, "checkOutMinFromStart": 300, "unpaidBreakMin": 90 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 240,
          "workedMin": 210,
          "floorApplied": true,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a check-out on the check-in timestamp is undetermined, not a zero-length shift",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 60, "checkOutMinFromStart": 60 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "undetermined",
          "payableMin": null,
          "workedMin": null,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a check-out before the check-in is undetermined, never the four-hour floor",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 180, "checkOutMinFromStart": 120 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "undetermined",
          "payableMin": null,
          "workedMin": null,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a check-in past the end of the role section intersects nothing",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 510, "checkOutMinFromStart": 540 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "undetermined",
          "payableMin": null,
          "workedMin": null,
          "floorApplied": false,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "one worked minute still floors: the empty-window guard must not swallow RULE-14",
        "input": { "checkOutMinFromStart": 1 },
        "expect": {
          "status": "settled",
          "payableMin": 240,
          "workedMin": 1,
          "floorApplied": true,
          "lateCheckOutFlag": false
        }
      }
    ]
  },

  "turnAway": {
    "$comment": [
      "turned_away_minutes, RULE-15. A flat four hours, not half the shift and not",
      "tied to its length, decided by the logged attempt (CheckLog.attempted_at)."
    ],
    "defaults": {
      "shiftMin": 480
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "on time is a fixed four hours",
        "input": { "attemptMinFromStart": 10 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 240
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the last minute of the grace is still on time",
        "input": { "attemptMinFromStart": 29 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 240
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "at start+30 the grace has elapsed and nothing is paid",
        "input": { "attemptMinFromStart": 30 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "late is paid nothing",
        "input": { "attemptMinFromStart": 45 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "arriving before the start is on time",
        "input": { "attemptMinFromStart": -20 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 240
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "four hours flat on a ten-hour shift",
        "input": { "shiftMin": 600, "attemptMinFromStart": 0 },
        "expect": {
          "payMin": 240
        }
      }
    ]
  },

  "breaks": {
    "$comment": [
      "break_window_minutes / unpaid_break_minutes, §5.2b and audit D49. Every break is",
      "clipped to the paid window [max(check-in, start), min(finish, end)] before it is",
      "deducted: RULE-01 never paid minutes outside it, so taking them again as a break",
      "would take them twice. finishMinFromStart is the manager-entered finish, the",
      "recorded check-out, or now for a shift still running. A break with no end runs",
      "to the finish. Each break is rounded to whole minutes, then summed."
    ],
    "defaults": {
      "shiftMin": 480,
      "checkInMinFromStart": 0,
      "finishMinFromStart": 480
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "a break inside the window is deducted in full",
        "input": { "breaks": [[180, 200]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 20
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "several breaks are summed",
        "input": {
          "breaks": [
            [120, 140],
            [300, 315]
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 35
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break before the scheduled start costs nothing",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": -30, "breaks": [[-25, -10]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break straddling the start is clipped to the start",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": -30, "breaks": [[-10, 10]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break before a late check-in costs nothing past it",
        "input": { "checkInMinFromStart": 45, "breaks": [[40, 60]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 15
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break after the scheduled end costs nothing",
        "input": { "finishMinFromStart": 540, "breaks": [[490, 520]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break straddling the end is clipped to the end",
        "input": { "finishMinFromStart": 540, "breaks": [[470, 500]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break still running ends at the finish",
        "input": { "finishMinFromStart": 300, "breaks": [[280, null]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 20
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break still running is clipped to the end as well",
        "input": { "finishMinFromStart": 600, "breaks": [[460, null]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 20
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a break past an early finish costs nothing",
        "input": { "finishMinFromStart": 200, "breaks": [[210, 230]] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "no breaks, nothing deducted",
        "input": { "breaks": [] },
        "expect": {
          "unpaidBreakMin": 0
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
